        "x1": 0.949770583661972,
        "y1": 0.31515781924491865
      },
      "text": "TROJAN. A boon companion ; a person who is fond of liquor. A cant term. According to some, a thief was so called ; but it was applied somewhat indiscriminately. A rough manly boy is now termed \" a fine Trojan.\" Grose",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
